  abilityId: 841028
  abilityName: Lightningspeed
  abilityDesc: 15 combo Thunder attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP, boosts own critical rate), probable 3 turns critical, elemental and spark
    vulnerability infliction, restores HP, may raise allies from KO, may activate
    BB/SBB/UBB twice for 3 turns & fills OD gauge
